Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: ExpiringSecret loan `borrowed` cannot be moved
  --> tests/ui/secrets_expiry/expiring_secret_loan_rejects_move_variadic_and_drop_paths.jet:14:17
    |
 14 |         consume(borrowed)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The callback receives temporary read access; moving, changing, or dropping it could let the credential escape its expiry boundary
 Fix: Use the loan only for read-only operations inside this callback
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

Error [jet.FallibleCallIgnored]: This call can fail and nothing checks it
  --> tests/ui/secrets_expiry/expiring_secret_loan_rejects_move_variadic_and_drop_paths.jet:14:9
    |
 14 |         consume(borrowed)
    |         ^^^^^^^
 Why: A fallible result can't be ignored — handle it or say failure is impossible
 Fix: Use `?`, `??`, `panic ...`, or `.drop("reason")` to intentionally discard
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0402

Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is Int (a whole number), but `run` returns Err!
  --> tests/ui/secrets_expiry/expiring_secret_loan_rejects_move_variadic_and_drop_paths.jet:15:16
    |
 15 |         return 0
    |                ^
 Why: `run` declares Err! as its result, so the value it hands back must be Err!
 Fix: Hand back a Err! value: convert this value to Err!, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113

Error [jet.MissingErrorConversion]: This implicit fallible call can't convert `Expired` into `Err` — no declared conversion exists
  --> tests/ui/secrets_expiry/expiring_secret_loan_rejects_move_variadic_and_drop_paths.jet:13:17
    |
 13 |     _ := secret.with((borrowed) -> {
    |                 ^^^^
 Why: Ordinary fallible calls propagate automatically; `Expired` can reach `Err` only through `impl Expired -> Err`
 Fix: Handle this call locally with `??`, add `impl Expired -> Err { … }`, or change the return type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2402
